    {
      "bbox": [
        425,
        1230,
        1387,
        1318
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "§ 2. All Executive Orders in effect on December 31, 1977, and continued by this Order designating by name officials holding office in the government of the City to perform functions set forth in such Executive Orders are hereby modified to the extent that such functions shall be performed by the persons holding such offices pursuant to my direction.",
