        1389,
        1405
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "§ 3. The head of the Council Against Poverty, the Title X Coordinator established by Executive Order No. 51 of February 4, 1976, and the heads of the constituent agencies administering Community Development program funds (with respect to those funds) shall hereafter report directly to the Mayor.",
      "logprob_stats": {
